{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot sent to a planet to set up a system to make it habitable for your creators. However, the makeup of its atmosphere leads to a challenging process along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build factories automated by drones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.poster.avif?t=1759193554\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.webm?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.mp4?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create systems to mine and process materials in automated pipelines. Configure drones to easily handle the logistics. Skyformer's automation is intended to be more casual than most automation games, with less calculations involved. It's an automation game that you can play at the end of a tiring day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terraform and track the weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.poster.avif?t=1759193554\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.webm?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.mp4?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The processed materials allow you to create and run a system that controls the climate, tracks the weather, and terraforms the planet. As you terraform, the planet becomes more capable of producing weather systems, some of which being quite destructive. This game has a dynamic weather system that interacts with the geography, producing microclimates in each region based on the current global climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the process and achieve habitability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.poster.avif?t=1759193554\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.webm?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.mp4?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing the climate of the planet can allow access to previously inhospitable regions, but can also do the opposite. Observing the weather and how the geography locally influences it is important to surviving the terraforming process. Different strategies can be used to survive storms, such as building up automated drone defense systems, strategically positioning buildings, or simply maximizing the power of your tools and taking storms head-on. The energy produced by the storms can also be harnessed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to achieve a climate that maximizes biomass across each region, and stabilize the atmosphere to the point at which storms are no longer destructive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Releasing the first map in singleplayer early access by Fall 2025.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Additional maps and co-op will be released through 2026.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Discord</strong> for the latest development updates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engine/programming/art by solo dev Weatherfused. Sound by Marty Meinerz. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2305210?t=1759193554","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759193554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/7bdfb446de2ce46bfdee96efda7a2cb575bd6061/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759193554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/7bdfb446de2ce46bfdee96efda7a2cb575bd6061/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759193554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3750530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot sent to a planet to set up a system to make it habitable for your creators. However, the makeup of its atmosphere leads to a challenging process along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build factories automated by drones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.poster.avif?t=1759193554\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.webm?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/7953ddd5f71dfb6e6d1b6ba5de273edc.mp4?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create systems to mine and process materials in automated pipelines. Configure drones to easily handle the logistics. Skyformer's automation is intended to be more casual than most automation games, with less calculations involved. It's an automation game that you can play at the end of a tiring day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terraform and track the weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.poster.avif?t=1759193554\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.webm?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/c58d6a86159c92c31d7c92047ec0683e.mp4?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The processed materials allow you to create and run a system that controls the climate, tracks the weather, and terraforms the planet. As you terraform, the planet becomes more capable of producing weather systems, some of which being quite destructive. This game has a dynamic weather system that interacts with the geography, producing microclimates in each region based on the current global climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the process and achieve habitability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.poster.avif?t=1759193554\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.webm?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/extras/5b3ee52b9ca7a5492675a80f6bde9d0f.mp4?t=1759193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing the climate of the planet can allow access to previously inhospitable regions, but can also do the opposite. Observing the weather and how the geography locally influences it is important to surviving the terraforming process. Different strategies can be used to survive storms, such as building up automated drone defense systems, strategically positioning buildings, or simply maximizing the power of your tools and taking storms head-on. The energy produced by the storms can also be harnessed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to achieve a climate that maximizes biomass across each region, and stabilize the atmosphere to the point at which storms are no longer destructive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Releasing the first map in singleplayer early access by Fall 2025.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Additional maps and co-op will be released through 2026.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Discord</strong> for the latest development updates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engine/programming/art by solo dev Weatherfused. Sound by Marty Meinerz. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Weatherfused"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305210/ccd76650c45433b50c0f8779bf41b0897d36173c/header.jpg?t=1759193554","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL Version 3.3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL Version 3.3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2305210/1917717943/18d21b83269317ef0806ffa2e854daf2216aa151/1750138982/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750141308","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2305210/1917717943/18d21b83269317ef0806ffa2e854daf2216aa151/1750138982/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750141308","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2305210/1917717943/18d21b83269317ef0806ffa2e854daf2216aa151/1750138982/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750141308","id":256956145,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256956145/movie480.mp4?t=1750141308","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256956145/movie_max.mp4?t=1750141308"},"n